ind":"announcement","title":"Why the Monk and the Misfit Monsters?","summary":"Most of you already know Journey to the West and its famous band of five: Tang Sanzang and his disciples. The story has been adapted into countless games, among them the stunning Black Myth: Wukong.What fewer people realize is that the master and his disciples were never chosen at random. They were all carefully arranged by the Buddha himself, each with an extraordinary past life. Tang Sanzang was once Golden Cicada, the second disciple of the Tathagata. Zhu Bajie was once Marshal Tianpeng. And ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:01:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694140","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4469080-1846651706691085","game_id":"steam-4469080","kind":"announcement","title":"Livestream from Developers","summary":"Livestream from Developers","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:28:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4469080-1846651706690650","game_id":"steam-4469080","kind":"announcement","title":"Monk & The Misfit Monsters joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We’re live at Steam Next Fest!Our new demo of Monk & The Misfit Monsters is available from 20–27 October. Grab it, fire it up, and see how long you can keep the bar standingWhat news?Choose your starting monk. Your initial choice shapes your entire team's journey. Build your strategy around Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth, exploiting elemental weaknesses to deal extra damage.Upgrade your heroes: Equip your team with powerful weapons to improve their combat abilities.Discover special location","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:01:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690650","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4469080-1844115010491078","game_id":"steam-4469080","kind":"announcement","title":"Monk & The Misfit Monsters demo is now live on Steam!","summary":"Hello,We are excited to announce that the Monk & The Misfit Monsters demo is now live on Steam. And there’s more Monk & The Misfit Monsters is joining Steam’s Party-Based Festival from October 14–20. If you’re looking for a new party-based RPG roguelike to try, now is the perfect time to join our journey to the West.What’s included in the DEMO version?We’d love to hear what you think about the Demo and see the formations and strategies you come up with!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T07:04:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4469080-1843481262701919","game_id":"steam-4469080","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is available NOW","summary":"Hello,We are excited to announce that the Monk & The Misfit Monsters demo is now live on Steam!A party-based RPG roguelike inspired by Journey to the West. Legend has it that anyone who follows Tang Sanzang to the Western Paradise and retrieves the sacred scriptures can become a Buddha even demons get a shot at enlightenment and immortality. Lead a band of nameless animals disguised as monks overcome trials, master magical powers, defeat demons, and journey West to meet the Buddha.If you have an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T14:55:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4469080-1841579228671295","game_id":"steam-4469080","kind":"announcement","title":"A party-based RPG roguelike inspired by Journey to the West.","summary":"Hi everyone! I’m Simon, the developer behind Monk & The Misfit Monsters, and I’m also the solo developer working on the game. Today, I’d like to share a little story about how this game came to be.You’ve probably heard of Journey to the West before. Tang Sanzang, Sun Wukong, Zhu Bajie, and Sha Wujing. We all know their journey to the West. But I found myself becoming more curious about the other side of the story: the little monsters and demons who usually appear only as obstacles along the way.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T12:11:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4469080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4469080":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4469080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z"},"5156130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:04Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4469080","app_id":4469080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISto